#~ msgid ""
#~ "If the night is clear, you can see amazing detail of the lunar surface "
#~ "just star gazing on in your back yard.\n"
#~ "Naturally, as you grow in your love of astronomy, you will find many "
#~ "celestial bodies fascinating. But the moon may always be our first love "
#~ "because is the one far away space object that has the unique distinction "
#~ "of flying close to the earth and upon which man has walked."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Om natten är klar kan du se fantastiska detaljer på månens yta bara genom "
#~ "att titta på stjärnorna i din trädgård.\n"
#~ "När din kärlek till astronomi växer kommer du naturligtvis att finna "
